[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（２８３プロダクションに入社して数か月……\r\nいよいよ俺が、アイドルをプロデュースする時が来た）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgm": "001"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ずっと憧れていた仕事をようやく任されたんだ、\r\nこれから精一杯頑張るぞ！）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おはようございます！\r\nって、天井社長……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010010,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "おはよう、お前を待っていたぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1902001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（この２８３プロダクションを束ねる\r\n天井社長……あいかわらずダンディな雰囲気だ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010020,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "お前には今日から、アイドルを\r\nプロデュースしてもらうと伝えていたが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1902001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010030,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "素晴らしい結果を期待させてもらう\r\n私は甘くないぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1902001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "は、はい！　よろしくお願いします！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010040,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "よろしい。では、仕事の説明ははづきに任せて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1902001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？　はづきさんはどこにも……あっ！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（そ、ソファの裏で誰かが倒れてる！？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010010,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "……ふわぁ～？\r\nなんですか～急に大きな声出して～……",
    "charAnim1": "sleep1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "charType": "sub_characters",
    "charId": "staff",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1901001010010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010050,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "は、はづき……なぜ床で寝ているんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1902001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010020,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "すみません、ソファへ着く前に\r\n眠気に負けてしまいまして～……",
    "charAnim1": "sleep2",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1901001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010060,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "せっかくまじめな雰囲気を出したというのに……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1902001010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010070,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……ともかく！\r\n彼に仕事の説明をしてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1902001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010030,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "はい、もちろんです\r\nプロデューサーさん、どうぞ～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1901001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\n……あいかわらず、わかりやすくまとまってますね、資料",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（はづきさん、こういうところは頼れるんだよな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010040,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\nそれじゃあ、さっそくお仕事の説明に入りますね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1901001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010050,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "まず、今回のプロデュースの目標についてですが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1901001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010060,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ワンダーアイドルノヴァ・グランプリ……\r\n通称『W.I.N.G.』への出場を目指してください",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1901001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『W.I.N.G.』……ですか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010070,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "はい\r\n新人アイドルの祭典とも言われる、すごいライブなんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1901001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010080,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "祭典と言われるだけあって、この『W.I.N.G.』は\r\n出場資格を手に入れるまでが厳しいんです……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1901001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010090,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "エントリーしたアイドルは開催前まで、\r\n全４回のシーズンごとに審査を受けます",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1901001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010100,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "その時、一定のランクに達していないと、\r\n出場資格を失ってしまうんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1901001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010110,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ですので、精一杯頑張っていきましょ～！\r\n私もたくさんサポートさせていただきますね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1901001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010080,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……少しアドバイスをしておくが、\r\nお前は、２８３プロダクションのプロデューサーだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1902001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010090,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "担当アイドルと他のアイドルたちを\r\n交流させることも重要になってくる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1902001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010100,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "互いに影響しあうことで目指せる高みもあるだろう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1902001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010110,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "まあ、まずは思うようにやってみるといい\r\n結果がついてくるかは、お前とアイドルの頑張り次第だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1902001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010120,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "では、そろそろお仕事に移ってもらいましょうか\r\n今回プロデュースするアイドルは──",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1901001010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "bgm": "fade_out",
    "effectLabel": "black99",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "x": 1000,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "bg": "00014"
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black99",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeInQuart"
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bgm": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010010,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "わ～♡\r\n今日はよろしくお願いします～！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1023001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……はい、よろしくお願いします\r\nそれでは、まず自己紹介を……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010020,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "は～い♡\r\n市川雛菜、高校１年生です～～～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "023",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1023001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとう\r\nアイドルを志望した理由を聞かせてくれるかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010030,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～とね～\r\n透先輩がアイドルやるって聞いて～……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1023001010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010040,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "すっごくいいな～、雛菜もやりたいな～\r\nって思って来ました♡",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1023001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど……\r\n次に特技を聞かせてください",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010050,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "特技～……？\r\nん～なんでもそれなりにできる～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1023001010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんでもそれなりに……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010060,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "運動とか勉強とか、割とできる！\r\nだからアイドルやるのも楽しみ～～～♡",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1023001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……\r\nアイドルはどんなイメージかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010070,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～、アイドルは～、\r\n楽しくてしあわせ～♡　ってイメージ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1023001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに、そういうイメージが\r\n強いかもしれないな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、アイドルは楽しいことばかりじゃない\r\n大変なこともたくさんあるぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010080,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "え～、大変なのはやだ～……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1023001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010081,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あっ！　雛菜は楽しい担当がいい！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1023001010081"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "楽しい担当……か",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010090,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "どんなことでも楽しく、\r\nしあわせ～にやるのがいちばんでしょ～？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1023001010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、アイドルとして\r\nファンにはいつも笑顔を見せてもらいたいよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010100,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ね～？\r\n雛菜、それ得意かも～～～♡",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1023001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010110,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "よく～、『雛菜はしあわせそうでいいね～』\r\nって言われるもん～～～",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1023001010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうか\r\n今もすごく楽しそうだし、いい笑顔だもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010120,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～♡\r\nありがとうございます～～～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1023001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010130,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜はどんな時でもね\r\n楽し～く、しあわせ～に過ごすの",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1023001010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001010140,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……みんなもそうしたらいいのにね？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300101/1023001010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、そうできたら\r\n一番いいんだろうけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "きっとそうできない人もいる\r\n……いや、そうできない人の方が多いんだよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だからそういう人を笑顔にするのが\r\nアイドルの仕事なんじゃないかって思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
